\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {C.1}{\ignorespaces Appendix C -- Login Screen (left) and Registration Screen (right). The login screen accepts email and password; the registration screen collects username, email, and password. Serves UC-01 (Registration) and UC-02 (Login).}}{98}{figure.caption.76}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {C.2}{\ignorespaces Appendix C -- Overview Dashboard (left) and Server List (right). The dashboard shows aggregate counts of servers, alerts, and incidents. The server list shows each server's name, environment, and health status. Serves UC-04 (Server Setup \& Metric Collection).}}{99}{figure.caption.77}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {C.3}{\ignorespaces Appendix C -- Server Metrics Detail (left) and Alert List (right). The metrics view renders time-series charts for CPU, memory, disk, and network. The alert list shows severity badges, state, and timestamps. Serves UC-04 and R-ALERT-01.}}{100}{figure.caption.78}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {C.4}{\ignorespaces Appendix C -- Incident List (left) and Incident Detail (right). The incident list shows severity, status, and assigned engineer. The detail view allows status updates and shows the full timeline. Serves UC-05 (Incident \& Anomaly Assignment).}}{101}{figure.caption.79}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {C.5}{\ignorespaces Appendix C -- Request Shield Analytics (left) and Request Log List (right). The analytics screen shows zone distribution (GREEN/GRAY/RED pie chart), top offending IPs, and trend over time. Serves UC-07 (Request Shield).}}{102}{figure.caption.80}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {C.6}{\ignorespaces Appendix C -- Request Log Detail (left) and Threat Suggestions List (right). The log detail view shows zone, classifier, confidence, and threat signals. The suggestions list shows pending, accepted, and dismissed suggestions. Serves UC-07.}}{103}{figure.caption.81}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {C.7}{\ignorespaces Appendix C -- AI Chatbot Context Selection (left) and Active Conversation (right). The left screen shows the anomaly selector and suggested prompts. The right screen shows the conversation with Gemini's advisory response streamed in real time. Serves UC-06 (AI Chatbot Conversation).}}{104}{figure.caption.82}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {C.8}{\ignorespaces Appendix C -- Organisation Members Screen (left) and Server Registration Screen (right). Members screen shows roles and approval status. Registration form collects server name, hostname, and environment. Serves UC-03 and UC-04.}}{105}{figure.caption.83}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {C.9}{\ignorespaces Appendix C -- Anomaly Detection List (left) and Anomaly Detail (right). The list shows anomaly scores, detection times, and assigned engineers. The detail view links to the AI chatbot for advisory diagnostics. Serves UC-05 and UC-06.}}{106}{figure.caption.84}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {C.10}{\ignorespaces Appendix C -- Shield Configuration Screen. Administrators can enable/disable the Request Shield and configure RED/GRAY threshold counts for threat suggestion generation. Serves UC-07 and R-SHIELD-04.}}{107}{figure.caption.85}%
